alls and emails from women asking  if he's single i'm just putting it out  there  he's not single he is married and he has  two beautiful children  and he is not available and yes we know  he looks like the rocky you ought to see  him in person  okay doc before we wrap it up you know  you got to do the thing  i have to do the thing you have to do  the thing yeah you ready  i'm ready  [Laughter]  that's the right that's the best i can  do  it's not doing him any justice but  that's the best i can do  oh you do him justice every time my  friend he'd be proud thank you so much  dr lopez  all right have a wonderful day all right  you too  see yeah yeah and don't forget folks hey  catch the mlj show facebook live we are  doing something really  cool tonight so make sure to tune in uh  you know the harmony  uh arm of the mlj show it's our charity  arm hope and relief mission we have  collaborated with  the emerald dream foundation you saw  them right here on the show we  interviewed them well guess what our  collaboration paid off  and we're going to showcase the first  person in our las vegas community  that has received help as a result of  our collaboration we're so proud of this  and she happens to be a local veteran  tune in at 7 pm for the moj show  facebook live
 

